T*
(                    \(excluding StratoNode-observed holidays\)) Tj
T*
(  Response Targets:) Tj
T*
(    - Severity 1 \(service down\):         1 hour) Tj
T*
(    - Severity 2 \(significant impact\):   4 hours) Tj
T*
(    - Severity 3 \(minor impact\):         1 business day) Tj
T*
(    - Severity 4 \(general inquiry\):      2 business days) Tj
T*
() Tj
